stants", "label": "RobotConstants", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/biobuzz/TURRET_LIMELIGHT_BRIEF.md", "source_location": "L757", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Single home for every unknown hardware value with safe placeholders and telemetry warnings, so code is not blocked on measurements."}, {"id": "docs_biobuzz_turret_limelight_brief_hardware_from_cad", "label": "Hardware from CAD (ring bearing, hooded shooter, 5203 flywheel)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/biobuzz/TURRET_LIMELIGHT_BRIEF.md", "source_location": "L84", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_biobuzz_turret_limelight_brief_camera_pose", "label": "Limelight camera pose (116.5 mm forward, +37 deg pitch, 0.354 m height)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/biobuzz/TURRET_LIMELIGHT_BRIEF.md", "source_location": "L102", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_biobuzz_turret_limelight_brief_turret_axis_offset", "label": "TURRET_AXIS_OFFSET", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/biobuzz/TURRET_LIMELIGHT_BRIEF.md", "source_location": "L128", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default (0,0); irrelevant for tx-closed-loop aim but matters for odometry-only aim and MegaTag2 corrections; must not be subtracted twice in fixed mode."}, {"id": "docs_biobuzz_turret_limelight_brief_field_of_view", "label": "Limelight FOV check (20-105 in range)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/biobuzz/TURRET_LIMELIGHT_BRIEF.md", "source_location": "L147", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_biobuzz_turret_limelight_brief_hive_cell", "label": "HIVE CELL (up-facing target)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/biobuzz/TURRET_LIMELIGHT_BRIEF.md", "source_location": "L170", "source_url": null, 